{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39126","headline":"登汉高庙闲眺 · 韦庄","name":"登汉高庙闲眺","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"独寻仙境上高原，云雨深藏古帝坛。\n天畔晚峰青簇簇，槛前春树碧团团。\n参差郭外楼台小，断续风中鼓角残。\n一带远光何处水，钓舟闲系夕阳滩。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦庄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39126.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39126","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}